1. Data Controller: The data controller for personal data is Agentes Inteligentes, based in Costa Rica; contact email: soporte@agentesinteligentes.org. This policy is issued in compliance with Law No. 8968 (Law on the Protection of Individuals with Regard to the Processing of Their Personal Data), its regulations, and other applicable legislation in Costa Rica, as well as international data protection principles applicable in Central America, Mexico, Spain, and the United States.
2. Scope: This Privacy Policy applies to all users of the mobile application AI-Workout-PRO (hereinafter, the "Application"), a physical training platform featuring an exclusive hybrid model that combines the best of sports science and cutting-edge technology—algorithmic logic and artificial intelligence—available to users in Costa Rica, Central America, Mexico, and the United States.
3. Personal Data Collected: The Application collects only the data necessary to provide the offered service, including:
•	Name
•	Email address
•	Age
•	Weight
•	Height
•	Body measurement indicators (thigh, chest, arm, waist) used to adapt routines based on the user's progress.
•	Physical condition information (which should be provided by a healthcare professional; the Application does not replace assessments by health professionals in the fields of physical conditioning and nutrition—users are advised to consult with such professionals before beginning training and to maintain a record of their physical condition).
Additionally, technical data—such as IP address, device information, and usage logs—may be collected for security, analytical, and operational purposes.
4. Sensitive Data: Data related to weight, height, and body measurement indicators are considered personal data and, by their nature, may be linked to information regarding the user's physical condition. These data will not be used for purposes other than those for which the application is intended; they will be used exclusively for generating physical conditioning routines via algorithms or artificial intelligence, under the user's own responsibility.
5. Purpose of processing: Personal data will be processed for the following purposes:
•	Creating and managing the user's account.
•	Personalizing workout routines using artificial intelligence.
•	Tracking the user's physical progress within the application.
•	Sending communications related to the operation of the service.
•	Ensuring the security, stability, and continuous improvement of the platform.
The data will not be used for purposes other than those described here without further consent from the data subject.
6. Legal basis for processing: The processing of personal data is based on:
•	The user's express, informed, and prior consent.
•	The execution of a contractual relationship arising from the use of the application.

7. Data transfer and storage: Personal data may be stored on servers located outside of Costa Rica, including cloud computing services, which entails international data transfers. The data controller guarantees that such providers comply with adequate standards for information security and confidentiality. Under no circumstances will personal data be sold, rented, or transferred to third parties for commercial purposes.
8. Data retention: Personal data will be retained as long as the user's account remains active, and subsequently for the period necessary to fulfill legal obligations or address liabilities arising from the use of the application. Users may request the deletion of their account and personal data in accordance with the section on data subject rights.
9. Rights of the data subject (ARCO rights): Users may, at any time, exercise the following rights:
•	Access
•	Rectification
•	Cancellation
•	Opposition

Requests must be sent to the email address soporte@agentesinteligentes.org, clearly stating the nature of the request. The data controller will address the request within a reasonable timeframe, in accordance with applicable law.
10. Security measures: The data controller implements reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect personal data, including access controls, encryption, and secure development practices. Nevertheless, the user acknowledges that no system is entirely infallible.
11. Use by minors: The Application is not intended for minors. In the event that the registration of individuals under the age of 18 is permitted, full responsibility shall lie with the adults who act as representatives and guardians of the minor.
12. Changes to the Privacy Policy: The data controller reserves the right to modify this Privacy Policy. Users will be notified of any modifications via the Application or by electronic means.
13. Acceptance: Use of the Application constitutes the user’s express acceptance of this Privacy Policy.
